<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 10 trln rbls in T-bills July 30.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 10 trln rbls in T-bills July 30.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Finance Ministry will auction four trillion roubles in an issue of 182-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 21081) and six trillion roubles in an issue of series 21082 364-day T-bills on July 30, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the auctions follow:  </p>
<p>Full details of series 21081 issue:</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		  1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date		     July 30, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor			    182 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Jan 28, 1998</p>
<p>Full details of series 21082 issue:</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   6.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		  1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date		     July 30, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor			    364 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  July 29, 1998</p>
<p>On July 30, the Finance Ministry will repay about 6.72 trillion roubles in a maturing 259-day T-bill (series 22058).</p>
<p>--Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
